JudasScene 3
settings
  name "Wet support review - dry coffer, floating and sinking props"
  world-origin 0 0 0
  sun-direction .4 .7 .35
  sun-color 1 .98 .92
  ambient .22 .23 .25
  fluid-scale 5
  fidelity-policy none
  next-id 19
end

